[h1]Print Extension List[/h1]

[h2][b]Features[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] On UI startup, writes a report to the debug log containing:
[list]
[*] Game version and build suffix.
[*] Every enabled DLC (id, name, version, date).
[*] Every enabled extension/mod (id, name, author, source, version, date).
[/list]
[/list]
[h2][b]Limitations[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] Debug-log only; there is no in-game UI, menu, or notification.
[*] No configuration - it always logs once per UI load.
[*] Oriented for mod developers to distribute with their mods, so that users can easily report their mod list to the developer inside the debug log.
[/list]
[h2][b]Requirements[/b][/h2]
[list]
[*] [b]X4: Foundations[/b] 8.00 or newer.
[/list]
[h2][b]Installation[/b][/h2]

You can download the latest version via Steam client - [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=]Print Extension List[/url]
Or you can do it via the Nexus Mods - [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/x4foundations/mods/]Print Extension List[/url]

[h2][b]Usage[/b][/h2]

Install and enable the extension. On the next game start look in the debug log for lines starting with prefix `PrintExtensionList:`.

